## Core Directories

<!-- List your main source directories and their purposes -->
<!-- Replace with your actual structure -->

### `/client` — Frontend Application
**Technology:** [e.g., React 18 + TypeScript 5 + Vite]

| Directory | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| `src/features/` | Feature modules (one per business capability) |
| `src/components/ui/` | Atomic UI components (Button, Input, Dialog) |
| `src/app/` | App configuration: router, stores, providers |

### `/server` — Backend Services
**Technology:** [e.g., Express + TypeScript + Prisma]

| Directory | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| `src/routes/` | HTTP route handlers |
| `src/services/` | Business logic and orchestration |
| `src/models/` | Database models (Prisma schema, etc.) |

### `/shared` — Shared Code
**Technology:** [e.g., TypeScript + Zod]

| Directory | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| `types/` | TypeScript interfaces used by both layers |
| `validations/` | Zod schemas shared between frontend and backend |

