## Notes for Agents

- **Always check ADRs** (`docs/40-decisions/`) before making architectural decisions
- **Never edit accepted ADRs** — create a new superseding ADR instead
- **Use domain terminology from this file** — do not invent your own terms
- If unsure about structure, run `ls` to verify before guessing
